%N A402496 Numbers k, such that omega(k) divides Sum_{d|k} omega(d), where omega = A001221.
%C A402496 Numbers k such that A001221(k) divides A062799(k).
%C A402496 Shares terms with A067340 until a(136). a(136) = 180, while A067340(136) = 181.
%C A402496 Contains A246655 (prime powers) and A005117 excluding 1 (squarefree numbers excluding 1).
%H A402496 Žiga Pirc, <a href="/A402496/b402496.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%e A402496 a(5) = 6, since omega(6) = 2, omega(1) + omega(2) + omega(3) + omega(6) = 4 and 2 divides 4.
%o A402496 (PARI) is_A402496(n) = if(n==1||n==0, 0, sumdiv(n, d, omega(d)) % omega(n) == 0);
%Y A402496 Cf. A001221, A062799, A067340, A246655, A005117.
%K A402496 nonn,new
